WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.087
Welcome to the Federal Modernization
Workbook's developer workbook,

2
00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:05.688
Building Provider Notices.

3
00:00:05.688 --> 00:00:11.100
This is Chapter 2: Microsoft 365
Message center and service health.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.837
Message center already tells a
tenant what will change and when.

5
00:00:14.837 --> 00:00:18.180
The work is reading it from
the API, on the right cloud,

6
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.900
and saying who decided
a post needs action.

7
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:24.885
We'll start from Microsoft Learn's
service communications API,

8
00:00:24.885 --> 00:00:29.713
see what it leaves to you, then read how
the kit fills the record from Chapter 1,

9
00:00:29.713 --> 00:00:32.625
and walk two labs, the
evidence and the dangers.

10
00:00:32.625 --> 00:00:34.200
Two notes before we begin.

11
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.562
This chapter is a draft,
awaiting the owner's review.

12
00:00:37.562 --> 00:00:41.140
And the code is illustrative,
tested against fixtures.
